OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain at
OL,6,Ffirst, most persistent in west from
OL,7,Fearly to mid-evening, clearing towards
OL,8,Fmidnight as clear spells and scattered
OL,9,Fshowers spread from west. Showers
OL,10,Fcontinuing overnight, with Inverness
OL,11,Fbest sheltered.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA day of showers mixed with
OL,14,Fbrighter spells. Showers quite
OL,15,Ffrequent across the Hebrides and west
OL,16,FHighland districts, where
OL,17,Fthunderstorms may develop later in the
OL,18,Fday. Brisk southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
