OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday brings showers, these heavier
OL,7,Flater. Sunday starts wet and windy,
OL,8,Fbefore clearing to blustery showers
OL,9,Ffor afternoon, some turning heavy.
OL,10,FMonday brings scattered light showers
OL,11,Fand brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
